<title>USA: Quanex plans $55 mln of spending on Piper.</title>
<headline>Quanex plans $55 mln of spending on Piper.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quanex Corp said Monday that it has approved capital programs totalling about $55 million for its new acquisition, Piper Impact Group.  </p>
<p>In a release Monday, Quanex said the capital spending plan will help supply new customer programs and developments in airbag technology.</p>
